Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to keep Yukki.\NYes, I would like him for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sixth quadrant i've\Nexcelled at academics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever since i was young and my\Nrank reflects that things have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been smooth sailing but you\Nmight say my personal life is a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bit dull i'm in need of a\Nlittle pet i want someone i can
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come home too and bring some\Nmuch-needed joy. If you're willing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be flexible and handsome over\Ni would be willing to endorse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you as the next supreme commander
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.77,0:02:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,become supreme
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,commander on my own not by\Nleveraging my inferiors oh dear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is our meeting over? What about dating\Nthe little slave in my free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Tenka said that she wants me? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems she's looking for a companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A companion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she wants a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's exactly\Nhow she put it. A pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm busy being the 7th\NSquadron's caretaker. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 7th Squadron does need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like I told Tenka, I have no\Ncontrol over your personal life. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is I don't really\Nhave a whole lot of free time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you lose weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
