Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels good that a gorgeous woman\Nlike her would want me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be a hero, not a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:03:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi. Ms. Tenka!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I snuck away to come see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a personal visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As in...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyo told you, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I have a crush on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you might like to be\Nmy boyfriend. Be your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a lackey or a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just called you a pet\Nbecause you're so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The slave devoted to his master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bravery won me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let's not forget your\Nimpressive housekeeping skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now I see you as more of a\Npet because you're young and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you grow up to be big and strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might spoil you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart won't stop racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had wanted to do this the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I doubt I can resist you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.43,0:05:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, is the shirt you're\Nwearing important to you? Huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a cheap old t-shirt I picked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's abusing your ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, can't you at least tell me\Nwhether you'll go out with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, I accept your proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, I need time to mull it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with option\Ntwo! Final answer! I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a bit too sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not necessarily a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which makes me think I should do\Nsomething to keep you from slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.27,0:06:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play video games!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pounced on him out of\Nnowhere when did you get so
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aggressive i must have been\Nunder the Little slave spell how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,indecent i know i said that\Ni wouldn't interfere in your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,personal life but Oh oh pick\Nme sneaking into another dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the middle of the night\Nis inconsiderate regardless
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of circumstance, it's immoral\Nbehavior and we should never
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,abuse our abilities there you\Nhave It point taken you're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dismissed go home already sure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,catch you later little slave
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worn out early morning\Npractice tomorrow Do not be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lend it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, in preparation for our\Nbattle against the humanoid Shuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to try lending my slave ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would enable you two to\Nutilize Yuuki when in slave form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my guess that his attributes\Nchange based on the person riding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't look the same when I wrote him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And depending on those attributes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would expand the list of strategic\Ntools available to us. Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combining our abilities with the\NCommander sounds like a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up first, Nei.\NGive it a shot. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I step on\Nyour back? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nay, take hold of the chains.
