Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.72,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{=1119}{\blur0.8\fs150\c&H965FFE&\bord0\shad0\frz4.357\pos(197.43,983.84)}SHINING STAR
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another form that's\Ndifferent from Himari's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might actually work! Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is Nei's version?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have to move around first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nei, can I test it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you move a lot slower\Nthan in Whirlwind mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand, my\Nsenses feel sharper than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyesight and my hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like for scouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I use my brand break trick and channel\Nenergy into my eyes, I can probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'M SEEING SOMETHING I REALLY SHOULDN'T!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'M SO SORRY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can see through our clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can see your backside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistake, you can just\Nface the other direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.81,0:10:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea! You're smart, Yukki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means it enhanced his eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An attribute like that could be\Nused to sniff out hidden Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it takes a heavy toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike Himari's learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lending my ability sucks a\Nconsiderable amount of my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Mr. Yuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:10:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body started moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please! It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the one responsible for paying an equal\Nprice is the borrower, not the lender.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assumed I would be in charge of his\Ncompensation while lending my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it!
