Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahem! Ahem! Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what Yuki's form is with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you positive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very likely you'll engage in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a full-blown fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your reward may end up being\Nmuch more extreme than Ney's was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extreme?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for your hard-earned reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the kind of thing you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a naughty boy, Yukki...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you can handle it? I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridding Shuki is the\NDemon Defense Forces job!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A silly reward won't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good answer. Hop on. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Shushu Suruga takes the reins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looks very excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.91,0:12:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give you some Shushu flair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
