Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel insanely strong, but\Nalso more sluggish than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look bulkier, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that he's powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not worth lending my\Nability for a simple upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I turn myself huge,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a pretty good chance that\NYuki would get bigger along with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heroes are always working out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to have a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.49,0:12:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradigm shift!
