Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Shushu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we won't be using\Nyour version in combat. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Kyoka, will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I will need to\Nget used to it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time, we'll prioritize your\Nskills with Nei as your writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nei, time to go. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get ready for school!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Nei joined the Demon\NDefense Force in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, be careful. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka, would it be alright\Nif I walked Nei to school today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to her a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:13:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's your superior, so it's\Nbest that you get to know her.
