Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you would like to know why i joined\Nyeah it's just it must be tough going to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,school and working for the demon defense\Nforce not having school every day does help
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus the demon defense force is a great
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cause since i might end\Nup finding my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some time ago, out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Nei's mother and father went missing,\Nall signs pointed to a Mato Mishap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:14:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, you've heard the rumors\Nfloating around, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About people receiving phone\Ncalls from their relatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who vanished in mishaps, or\Ncatching glimpses of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear stories like that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.05,0:15:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you joined the Demon\NDefense Force because...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I ate a peach and\Ngained my clairvoyant powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Ney's feelings\Nmanifested as her ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hence the name of your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure to find!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.27,0:15:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I believe my big\Nsister's still out there. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A message from the Supreme Commander? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:15:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we locate the humanoid Shuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we aren't to engage with them\Nuntil she gives the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like her goal is to create\Na dialogue with the humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she wants to assess\Nhow intelligent they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the type to attack\Nfirst and ask questions never.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all goes well, she believes we\Ncould reveal the mysteries of Mato,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,solve the Shuki problem,\Nand prevent Mato mishaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wishful thinking at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to gather all\Ncommanders for meetings soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please present your opinion then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt the Shuki are\Ngoing to respond to his summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would probably devolve\Ninto a battle anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixth squad devotes its complete\Ncooperation to the seventh squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.49,0:16:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.73,0:16:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but can you grab\Nsome water for Tenka? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to tease you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka, you're not drunk, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we test that theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By doing what, exactly? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nei has a strong feeling\Nshe shouldn't watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've spotted the appearance\Nof numerous gateways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coordinates confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help is on the way. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drop you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:17:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Miss Tenka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I stay in assist? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This area is under our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll handle the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Miss Tenka. Let's move. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kind of seems like Miss\NKyoka's in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I know I said that I wouldn't\Ninterfere in your personal life,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm taking it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be no more fawning over another\Nsquad's commander at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're in need of\Nharsher disciplinary methods?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's beat the shit out of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha! A new type!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:19:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it regenerates quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to bow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mighty Blade Cross!
