Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they got a minster kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Augmented Shuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are good in theory, but\Nnot so good in practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to have a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans like combining and\Nmodifying stuff too, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess having that level of\Ndurability is basically useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never understand what's\Ngoing on in that head of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do you think I should try next?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:20:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I transformed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The things you said to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hype me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly are a slave\Nat heart, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only makes me want you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think my personal life is\Ngoing to be as tall from now on
